<title>USA: Delta Airlines stake held by FMR group.</title>
<headline>Delta Airlines stake held by FMR group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Tuesday it holds a 1.50 percent stake in Delta Airlines Inc, or 1,155,667 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Delta in a 13G filing. FMR Corp is the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
